Unsething

Unsething is a modified work derived from the Horos Project, originally based on
OsiriX. The upstream application's LGPL version 3 notice is preserved verbatim
in LICENSES/Horos-upstream-NOTICE.txt. Original author and copyright notices in
source files remain applicable. The license texts are in LICENSE and COPYING.LESSER.

Unsething modifications include branding, Italian/English localization, toolbar
and icon fixes, discovery and opening of local legacy databases, build and
packaging scripts, and integration of newer imaging
and networking libraries. See Changelog.md and docs/DEVELOPMENT.md.

The preserved upstream notice describes its historical build, including Grok
and HorosCloud. Those statements do not describe the current Unsething build:
Grok is absent and JPEG 2000 decoding/encoding uses OpenJPEG. Upstream product
names and trademarks identify provenance or compatibility, not endorsement.

Third-party code and resources retain their original licenses. See
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and LICENSES. This source import does not retag or
represent earlier distributed installers as builds of this commit.
